{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "He hasn't called you himself?": "",
  "No, he hasn't... Oh! But...": "",
  "I did get a few calls from an unknown number that I didn't answer.": "",
  "And you're sure that's not just the company phone or something?": "",
  "Yes, I'm sure. I know what those numbers look like.": "",
  "(Tanaka-san said he'd been getting her voicemail, though...)": "",
  "(In fact, that was specifically what triggered him to ask me to take this case...)": "",
  "(...And Morimiya-san said she's been getting calls from an unknown number. What does this mean...?)": "",
  "(This sounds awfully familiar...)": "",
  "...Asami Morimiya...": "",
  "Yes, I'm worried about her. She was having trouble with a stalker named Inamoto, a client at our firm...": "",
  "Inamoto is actually the son of the CEO, which made things complicated, but then Asami-kun disappeared...": "",
  "H-Hold on! Haven't you already told me all of this?": "",
  "I mean, you already contracted me to find Morimiya-san... Didn't you?": "",
  "(Oh no... The first Tanaka is...)": "",
  "Sorry, but real quick—this Inamoto, is he in his thirties, with dark hair, and maybe a little on the pale side...?": "",
  "What!? He is, but... how did you know that?": "",
  "As I thought. Sir, I'll be in touch.": "",
  "So you figured it out, huh? Whatever. As long as I have Asami-chan.": "",
  "...Damn. You've been tailing me?": "",
  "I was beginning to suspect that you might figure it out.": "",
  "And I did. But too late.": "",
  "Hahaha... Don't worry about it. You did manage to find Asami, after all.": "",
  "And then you figured out me too! You're quite an ace detective.": "",
  "Inamoto-san! Why are you here!?": "",
  "...Asami! I think there's been a misunderstanding. But I'm sure we can talk things out between us...": "",
  "You and I... are bound by the red string of fate that connects two souls.": "",
  "I don't...": "",
  "So Asami... Let's go.": "",
  "(What, is he busy gaming? Guess I better hit the net café...)": "",
  "Hey Tsukumo. Did you get my message?": "",
  "Heh... What's the haps, Yagami-shi?": "",
  "You said you needed something from me?": "",
  "Right. I've got a favor to ask.": "",
  "Wait, Showa Street? Why'd you have it delivered all the way down there?": "",
  "I clicked the wrong address, okay? And walking down there sounds like a pain, soooo...": "",
  "Fine, I'll do it, but you're gonna take care of this for me, right?": "",
  "(All right, the Poppo on Showa Street. Better get this over with.)": "",
  "Hahaha! You're like a hero taking on a stupid fetch quest in an RPG, Yagami-shi. Now make haste, oh brave warrior!": "",
  "Whoa! What's wrong?": "",
  "Help, Yagami-san! This is bad!": "",
  "W-Wait...Aren't you that girl from the haunted apartment... thing?": "",
  "Yes, Yukako Oki!": "",
  "Yagami-san, you're a detective, aren't you!? I need your help!": "",
  "Try to calm down. What happened?": "",
  "He...! Mamoru is missing!": "",
  "Missing...!? Mamoru was your boyfriend, right? Shimazu-san?": "",
  "Yes, Mamoru Shimazu! My darling shnookums! He's missing!": "",
  "How long has he been gone?": "",
  "Two hours! It's been a full two hours since he contacted me!": "",
  "Wait... Two hours? I mean... that's all?": "",
  "What do you mean, \"that's all\"!? This is serious!": "",
  "How about you take a deep breath and explain what happened?": "",
  "...Y-Yes. All right.": "",
  "Ever since that thing with the apartment, the love Mamoru and I share has only grown deeper.": "",
  "When we can't see each other, we make sure to contact each other every twenty minutes.": "",
  "...Every 20 minutes?": "",
  "It's hardly enough... But we both have jobs now, so it's the best we can do.": "",
  "(These two are nuts. But I knew that already, didn't I?)": "",
  "But it's been over two hours since I heard from him now!": "",
  "Could it be that... he got busy with work? Or something like that?": "",
  "That was my first thought too, so I called the company. But they said he hadn't even showed up today...": "",
  "But I know he got up and left for work this morning!": "",
  "And if he's not there, something terrible must have happened to him!": "",
  "I went to the police, but they wouldn't even take me seriously, much less organize a search party!": "",
  "I don't know what I'd do if something happened to him! I would probably just die!": "",
  "O-Okay Yukako, you're at like a ten, can I please ask you to come down to a six?": "",
  "It's only been two hours. Have you considered that he might just... come back?": "",
  "You don't believe me either!?": "",
  "Y-You're with them, aren't you!? Where did you take my sweet pickle puppy!?": "",
  "Whoa, back it up. How did you even survive a leap of logic that long? I didn't take him.": "",
  "If you didn't take him, then help find him! Please! I'll kill myself right here and now if you don't!": "",
  "O-Okay, okay! I'm on the case!": "",
  "...I'm charging the same as last time, though. 80,000 yen work for you?": "",
  "Yes! Just find him as soon as possible!": "",
  "But we don't have any leads right now. Unless you have anything you can find on your phone?": "",
  "Come to think of it... I think Mamoru did set up some kinda GPS thingy on here...": "",
  "Huh? Wait, you have location sharing turned on?": "",
  "Ahaha. Yeah, whoops. That totally slipped my mind...": "",
  "Well, can you check? That might crack the case, you know.": "",
  "Of course! Hold on...": "",
  "Got it! He's at Theater Square!": "",
  "Okay, tell you what. You go wait at home to see if he starts heading back, and I'll head to Theater Square.": "",
  "O-Okay, good point.": "",
  "I'll head there now, then. Call me if anything happens.": "",
  "(Well... Let's just hope he's there.)": "",
  "(This smartphone... Is it Shimazu-san's?)": "",
  "(Woah, the list of missed calls from Yukako-san is insane, but... I knew it would be.)": "",
  "(I think that confirms that this is Shimazu-san's phone, but he's nowhere to be found...)": "",
  "(Hm? Shimazu-san's phone is ringing...)": "",
  "(Hm. Guess I may as well answer.)": "",
  "Heh heh heh. Yukako Oki? If you're worried about Mamoru...": "",
  "Then come to Kamuro Hills. Immediately.": "",
  "What? Wait—": "",
  "(They hung up. What's going on? I better get to Kamuro Hills!)": "",
  "(I guess I should let Yukako know, though. Damn.)": "",
  "Hello? Yukako-san?": "",
  "Yagami-san, where's Mamoru!?": "",
  "I'm afraid he wasn't here. Just his smartphone.": "",
  "And then a strange man called and said to go to Kamuro Hills before hanging up.": "",
  "What!? Is Mamoru okay!?": "",
  "Does that mean he was kidnapped!?": "",
  "I can't be sure. They didn't demand a ransom though, which would be typical of kidnappers.": "",
  "But the person who called assumed it would be you who answered.": "",
  "They specifically called to give you that message.": "",
  "I don't really get it either, but I'm heading to Kamuro Hills to get to the bottom of this.": "",
  "I-I'm going too!": "",
  "All right. See you there. Be careful, though.": "",
  "(Okay, let's head to the front of Kamuro Hills.)": "",
  "Huh? Shimazu-san?": "",
  "Surpriiise! Huh? Yagami-san?": "",
  "I've been looking for you, man. Where were you and what were you doing?": "",
  "Wait, if you're looking for me... Does that mean Yukako hired you?": "",
  "Um... What the heck is going on?": "",
  "I picked up your phone and I got a pretty threatening call.": "",
  "That was you on the other end, Yagami-san? That's... not how that was supposed to go.": "",
  "Mamoru!": "",
  "Oh. Yukako... Surpriiise!": "",
  "Forget that! Where <font_kind=yakuza_italic>were</font_kind> you!?": "",
  "O-Oh, are you upset?": "",
  "Of course I am! I was worried sick!": "",
  "You weren't... You weren't meeting another woman, were you!?": "",
  "W-W-What are you saying, Yukako!? I'm not even capable of that!": "",
  "Then what were you doing!?": "",
  "Okay, Yukako! Close your eyes real quick!": "",
  "Huh? Excuse me!?": "",
  "Just close your eyes, Yukako!": "",
  "What in the hell...": "",
  "T-Tokunaga-san?": "",
  "Oh? Yagami-san... What brings you here?": "",
  "It's a long story... The real question is, why are YOU here?": "",
  "Oh, Mamoru asked me to come, man. We're bros, so I told him I'd be glad to be his girlfriend's present.": "",
  "What? You're... a present?": "",
  "Yeah, me and this guy go all the way back to high school. I knew Yukako was a fan, so...": "",
  "I planned it all out as a surprise for her birthday. Dropping the smartphone was part of it, but...": "",
  "Oh. And that's why you called...": "",
  "Hey, uh, guys? How long do I have to keep my eyes closed?": "",
  "Oh, sorry, sorry. Okay...": "",
  "Ahhh!": "",
  "Woaaahh...!": "",
  "You... You were wearing a wig?": "",
  "N-No! It's a hat! Y-Yeah!": "",
  "Yagami-san, go after it!": "",
  "Huh? Again?": "",
  "Come on! Mamoru's girlfriend can't see me like this!": "",
  "Hey, come on! How long do I have to keep my eyes shut!?": "",
  "Hurry up, Yagami-san! She's going to open her eyes!": "",
  "Phew... That was clutch, man.": "",
  "Okay, Yukako. You can open your eyes now!": "",
  "...Wait, what? No way!? NO WAY!?": "",
  "Surpriiiise! Happy birthday, Yukako-san!": "",
  "Toya!? Huh!? What!? How!?": "",
  "Happy birthday, Yukako! He's my present for you!": "",
  "I-Is this what you've been up to, Mamoru!?": "",
  "I had to get things ready, so I couldn't get in touch. I'm sorry for worrying you, Yukako.": "",
  "O-Oh. Well then why didn't you just tell me, monkey muffin?": "",
  "Then it wouldn't be a surprise, would it, my sugar booger?": "",
  "You're lucky to have a guy who can make you smile, Yukako-san.": "",
  "(I see no one wants to stop and consider what I just went through...)": "",
  "Hey... Can I go now?": "",
  "Oh, yeah. Here's your fee, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Shall we, then? I've got a reservation at that Italian place you love!": "",
  "Yay! Let's go, let's go!": "",
  "Aw, you two are a couple peas in a pod. You sure I'm not just a third wheel here?": "",
  "Of course not! I'm so happy you're here!": "",
  "(That's twice this couple has taken me on a ride...)": "",
  "...A gun shot?": "",
  "A-Ahh!": "",
  "You guys are a stain on this city...": "",
  "Hello? Yes, there's someone with a gun in Theater Square... I think he's trying to take on that Keihin Gang.": "",
  "Sh-Shit!": "",
  "(How the hell did a civilian get his hands on a gun?)": "",
  "Obayashi-san, right? I'm Yagami.": "",
  "Ah, I've been waiting for you. You're here to help catch the mouse, right?": "",
  "Right... What kind of \"mouse\" are we talking about here? You mentioned it was precious.": "",
  "Precious indeed. It's a golden mouse...": "",
  "Okay... Care to explain?": "",
  "Hm? What's all this about?": "",
  "They're here to catch the mouse too. The mouse we've lured out!": "",
  "Never really saw myself as a mouse...": "",
  "We bring him down and we split the prize! Fuck him up, boys!": "",
  "Whoa, what's going on!?": "",
  "Hey, I need some answers here!": "",
  "You still don't get it? We lured you here so we could take you out without getting seen.": "",
  "Sure, but what did I ever do to piss you guys off?": "",
  "You haven't heard about the bounty on your head?": "",
  "A bounty? On <font_kind=yakuza_italic>me</font_kind>?": "",
  "Rumor has it, you've made an enemy of the Keihin Gang.": "",
  "They're gonna pay big cash to anyone who can bring you in.": "",
  "(I guess defeating all four of those losers does count as pissing them off...)": "",
  "How much cash are we talking?": "",
  "Ten million yen.": "",
  "T-Ten million!?": "",
  "They're handing out fliers on every block. They're desperate to get revenge.": "",
  "This whole city's going to be looking for you!": "",
  "N-No freakin' way...": "",
  "It's him! It's ten million yen!": "",
  "Ten mil! Ten mil!": "",
  "Wha!? What are you brats doing here!?": "",
  "Hey, don't let that guy move!": "",
  "Stop him!": "",
  "Hahaha, running is useless! You're not safe anywhere in Kamurocho!": "",
  "Shit! How did it come to this!?": "",
  "Tch... Dead end...": "",
  "Ack!": "",
  "Damn!": "",
  "The ten million yen man... Where's the ten million yen man!!": "",
  "I heard he was in the area...": "",
  "(Really? I can't even walk down the street at this rate...)": "",
  "(All right, maybe this'll be enough of a disguise to get through.)": "",
  "(But I've gotta do something about this. Quickly.)": "",
  "(Gotta arm myself with some intel...)": "",
  "(C-Crap!)": "",
  "Hey, Kim-san.": "",
  "It's me, Yagami.": "",
  "Yagami-san? Why are you dressed like a weirdo?": "",
  "I've got a situation on my hands... The whole city's kinda after me at the moment.": "",
  "And I'm going to need info on the Keihin Gang to get out of this. I figured you'd be the guy to talk to.": "",
  "Y-Yeah, I can help, I guess.": "",
  "Ten million yen? That's a LOT!": "",
  "Yeah, the math's not adding up, right?": "",
  "I dunno, maybe it does? You did defeat the entire Keihin Four...": "",
  "And from what I've heard, the Keihin Gang's been on the up lately.": "",
  "Really? How'd they get so profitable?": "",
  "A guy named Koga has been trafficking guns. He's got 'em so cheap, even kids can buy them.": "",
  "(Guns? Now that I think about it...)": "",
  "(Maybe that guy in Theater Square bought his gun from the Keihin Gang too...)": "",
  "But still, they can really afford to just fork over ten mil? That's insane.": "",
  "If they're that profitable, you'd think the police would've caught on by now.": "",
  "Well, the way I hear it, the cops can't seem to trace the guns.": "",
  "Oh come on, how hard could it be if even kids can buy them?": "",
  "I'd guess they've got some kind of special transaction method. They're smarter than they look.": "",
  "Just a guess, though.": "",
  "It sounds like you're in danger, Yagami-san. Maybe you should consider getting out of town?": "",
  "Hell no. For what it's worth, I actually like this city. And I'm not letting those punks drive me out.": "",
  "But it's only a matter of time 'til you get hurt...": "",
  "I guess I better make the first move.": "",
  "You?": "",
  "Yeah. I've just gotta figure out how they're smuggling these guns and cut the funds off at the source.": "",
  "No funds, no ridiculous prize money on my head.": "",
  "I-I see... That's certainly a plan.": "",
  "Thanks for the info, Kim-san. I'm gonna get to work.": "",
  "Of course! And I'll see what I can dig up too. In the meantime, feel free to use my place as a hideout!": "",
  "(When the whole city's out to get me, I'm glad I've got friends like Kim-san.)": "",
  "(...Should I try calling for help?)": "",
  "(No, I shouldn't. It's too risky.)": "",
  "(...I guess a consultation couldn't hurt. Let's make a call or two.)": "",
  "(I don't want to put anyone in danger, so I probably better call some people who can hold their own in a fight.)": "",
  "(I couldn't get a hold of Kaito-san... But by the look of things, I won't need him. This is awesome.)": "",
  "Listen, guys. I'm having some trouble with the Keihin Gang, so I called you because I could use some help.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "I don't...": "ผมไม่...",
  "Ahhh!": "อ๊าาา!",
  "Huh? Again?": "หา? อีกแล้วเหรอ?",
  "T-Ten million!?": "ส-สิบล้านเลยเหรอ!?",
  "Ack!": "อั๊ก!",
  "Damn!": "บ้าเอ๊ย!",
  "You?": "เธอเหรอ?"
 }
}
